    "canonicalType": "KnowledgeStatement",
    "label": "名称暂不可用",
    "aliases": [],
    "description": "For a DC motor in unity feedback with a proportional controller D_c(s)=k_P, the system is Type 0 for disturbance inputs and the steady-state error to a unit-step torque input is e_ss = -B/(A k_P). With a PI controller D_c(s)=k_P + k_I/s, the system is Type 1 for disturbance inputs and the error to a unit-ramp disturbance input is e_ss = -B/(A k_I).",
